      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The historic Jacobs Family Berry Farm, located in Gardnerville, is known for producing some of the best raspberries, blackberries, and black raspberries in the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
